{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46117","headline":"陈情献蜀皇帝 · 贯休","name":"陈情献蜀皇帝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河北江东处处灾，唯闻全蜀勿尘埃。\n一缾一鉢垂垂老，千水千山得得来。\n奈菀幽栖多胜景，巴歈陈贡媿非才。\n自慙林薮龙锺者，亦得亲登郭隗台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}